<title>SPAIN: Spain Oct deficit due to prior payments delays.</title>
<headline>Spain Oct deficit due to prior payments delays.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish Economy Ministry said on Monday that a budget deficit of 55.2 billion pesetas was due to delayed payments from previous years.</p>
<p>In a statement, the ministry said that if it were not for these payments, budget data in October would have shown a surplus of 84.9 billion pesetas.</p>
</text>
